## Applied filter
Enter these values in the KHI Web UI filter to see the same data.

```yaml
timelineQuery: {{ yamlBlock .TimelineQuery }}
timelineExclusionQuery: {{ yamlBlock .TimelineExclusionQuery }}
logQuery: {{ yamlBlock .LogQuery }}
startTime: {{ if not .StartTime.IsZero }}{{ time .StartTime }}{{ else }}""{{ end }}
endTime: {{ if not .EndTime.IsZero }}{{ time .EndTime }}{{ else }}""{{ end }}
excludeTimelinesWithoutLogs: {{ .ExcludeTimelinesWithoutLogs }}
```
